.$ Furthermore:\n\n- If the graph touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *even*.\n\n- If the graph crosses the $x$-axis at $x=a,$ the multiplicity of a root $x=a$ is *odd*.\n\nIn our case, the graph is *tangent* to the $x$-axis at $x=\\frac{7}{2}.$ So, $x=\\frac{7}{2}$ is a *multiple* root. \n\nFurthermore, the graph touches the $x$-axis and reverses direction at $x=\\frac{7}{2}.$ So, $x=\\frac{7}{2}$ has *even* multiplicity.\n\nTherefore, $x=\\frac{7}{2}$ is a multiple root of even multiplicity." :question/difficulty :question.difficulty/hard :question/answer-fields ["fb80726b-7bbd-555f-b65c-e3f390320a68"] :db/ensure :question/validate} {:db/id "757088d6-c6bd-5975-94af-daf65c82f561" :answer/id #uuid "757088d6-c6bd-5975-94af-daf65c82f561" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=- \\frac{1}{2}$ is a simple root of even multiplicity" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "76ff25e3-95a5-5ab3-a395-e8dc6c8d8fe2" :answer/id #uuid "76ff25e3-95a5-5ab3-a395-e8dc6c8d8fe2" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=- \\frac{1}{2}$ is not a root of $p(x)$" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "dfdcf8a0-d2a4-5119-b0f4-f87872b138ac" :answer/id #uuid "dfdcf8a0-d2a4-5119-b0f4-f87872b138ac" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=- \\frac{1}{2}$ is a multiple root of odd multiplicity" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "97766a81-393a-5274-8ee2-07d856979c22" :answer/id #uuid "97766a81-393a-5274-8ee2-07d856979c22" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=- \\frac{1}{2}$ is a multiple root of even multiplicity" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "4ad14b4f-7a42-59e6-aab8-dfda0548c54f" :answer/id #uuid "4ad14b4f-7a42-59e6-aab8-dfda0548c54f" :answer/type :answer.type/text :answer/value "$x=- \\frac{1}{2}$ is a simple root" :db/ensure :answer/validate} {:db/id "434b1a1a-cf51-5571-b3e0-34777ece8a37" :answer-field/id #uuid "434b1a1a-cf51-5571-b3e0-34777ece8a37" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/ty